      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AARDIES A STAR NZ (2) makes his first appearance since he was midfield from the back row in July's Protostar. Won from a wider barrier at this circuit and distance the last time he started outside of Group company. Readied with a trial win and should get his chance from the low draw. BETTOR ONE (4) continued a string of top-three results from last campaign when he came from wider for second when at this circuit and distance last week. That was his first appearance for more than three months and he won his lone second-up attempt so should be improved. He is a threat as is BLACKJACK SAM (5) who is hard to knock having recorded two wins and a very close second from this barrier in his last three attempts at this circuit and distance. HARRY THE HAT (6) draws wider but is worth including off a last-start win here.",
